sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Client Application
    participant KServe as KServe / Platform<br/>Serving Infrastructure
    participant APIServer as vLLM API Server<br/>:8000/TCP HTTP
    participant Engine as vLLM Inference Engine
    participant HPUWorker as vllm_gaudi HPU Worker
    participant ModelRunner as HPU Model Runner
    participant Gaudi as Intel Gaudi Accelerator<br/>(via SynapseAI Runtime)
    participant Storage as Model Storage<br/>(configured at startup)

    Note over APIServer,Storage: Container Startup - Model Loading
    APIServer->>Engine: Initialize inference engine
    Engine->>HPUWorker: Initialize HPU worker processes
    HPUWorker->>Storage: Load model weights from storage path
    Storage-->>HPUWorker: Model artifacts (weights, config)
    HPUWorker->>Gaudi: Transfer model to Gaudi HPU memory
    Gaudi-->>HPUWorker: Model loaded on device

    Note over Client,Gaudi: Runtime - Inference Request Flow
    Client->>KServe: POST /v1/completions<br/>or /v1/chat/completions
    KServe->>APIServer: Forward request<br/>(OpenAI-compatible HTTP)
    APIServer->>Engine: Parse & validate request
    Engine->>HPUWorker: Schedule inference batch
    HPUWorker->>ModelRunner: Execute model forward pass
    ModelRunner->>Gaudi: Run inference on HPU<br/>(SynapseAI graph execution)
    Gaudi-->>ModelRunner: Inference result tensors
    ModelRunner-->>HPUWorker: Decoded tokens
    HPUWorker-->>Engine: Generation output
    Engine-->>APIServer: Format response
    APIServer-->>KServe: JSON response
    KServe-->>Client: OpenAI-compatible response

    Note over Client,Gaudi: Speculative Decoding (Optional)
    Engine->>HPUWorker: Schedule speculative decode batch
    HPUWorker->>ModelRunner: Draft model forward pass
    ModelRunner->>Gaudi: Run draft inference
    Gaudi-->>ModelRunner: Draft tokens
    ModelRunner->>Gaudi: Verify with target model
    Gaudi-->>ModelRunner: Verified tokens
    ModelRunner-->>HPUWorker: Accepted tokens
    HPUWorker-->>Engine: Speculative output
